# spec-drift-check.sh allowlist (spec/13-tasks.md T-7).
#
# Path patterns (extended regex) whose changes do NOT require a
# corresponding update to spec/. Keep this file short: every
# exception erodes the spec/code invariant the check exists to enforce.
#
# Format: one path pattern per line.  Blank lines and lines starting
# with `#` are ignored.  Patterns are matched against paths returned
# by `git diff --name-only`, which are always relative to the
# **monorepo root** — e.g.
# `person/person-service-with-loco/src/matching/mod.rs`, not
# `src/matching/mod.rs` — so write patterns with that full prefix.

# — none currently —
